From c7bc59869b4d28cf4969c987e843d1eddffe1928 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter M <petermm@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:14:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Allow DHCP leases behind Wi-Fi AP proxy ARP

An AP can answer ARP announcements with the leased station address and the
AP MAC. Full address-conflict detection then declines the valid DHCP lease.
Keep the normal DHCP bind path and disable its ACD check on the ESP ports.

Original-patch: 0007-esp32-allow-dhcp-with-ap-proxy-arp.patch
Original-author/date: inferred from AtomVM commit
57de16db46a63b82c7880199ddc875870338b680; original patch has no headers.
---
